# {{WIKI_NAME}}

{{BOUNDARY_CAP}} knowledge base + **single durable vault** (LLM-Wiki / Karpathy pattern). Plain markdown — open as an Obsidian vault. Maintained **in-session by Claude Code**. Reusable machinery is the **wiki-engine** Claude Code plugin; `.engine-version` records the release this vault needs.

- Agent entry point: [CLAUDE.md](CLAUDE.md) (thin router; imports the engine)
- Day-to-day usage and conventions: the engine's `USAGE.md` and `SCHEMA.md` (github.com/pleejr/wiki-engine)
- Navigation: [index.md](index.md) · history: [log.md](log.md)
- `boundary: {{BOUNDARY}}`. **No secrets.** Single git identity.

New machine: install the plugin (`claude plugin marketplace add pleejr/wiki-engine`, then `claude plugin install wiki-engine@wiki-engine --scope user`), clone this repo, and run the engine's `bin/wire-machine.sh --wiki <clone> --wire-env --wire-claude-md`.
